{"title": "Oil", "pageid": 6460, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Oil", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the slick surface that can be ignited. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Oil_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Oil (disambiguation)\">Oil (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Oil_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Oil_surface.png/300px-Oil_surface.png.webp, /w/images/3/37/Oil_surface.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Oil image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Oil_surface.png/300px-Oil_surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Oil_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Oil</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a>. Oil surfaces have no effects while stepping on them, however will ignite and turn into a <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a> surface when in contact with flame, such as from a <a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a> spell or a lit <a href=\"/wiki/Candle\" title=\"Candle\">Candle</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Flammable.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oil_Barrel\" title=\"Oil Barrel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Oil_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Oil_Barrel\" title=\"Oil Barrel\">Oil Barrel</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oil_Flask\" title=\"Oil Flask\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/GRN_Oil_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Oil_Flask\" title=\"Oil Flask\">Oil Flask</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Turns into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a> surface when hit with Fire damage.</li></ul>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 224px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 222px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Oil_Surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Oil barrels and Oil Surfaces.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_Surface.png/333px-Oil_Surface.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_Surface.png/499px-Oil_Surface.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_Surface.png/665px-Oil_Surface.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oil barrels and Oil Surfaces.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_Surface.png/333px-Oil_Surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"222\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Oil_Surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Oil barrels and Oil Surfaces.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714224435\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1316/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11569/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3038/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1415/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 955362/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.494      1 -total\n 98.50%   41.856      1 Template:Area_page\n 26.04%   11.065      2 Template:Item_ico